{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"open-textbooks/wb-spanish/index.html","title":"Overview and preface","text":"Open TextbooksSpanishA course in the Spanish languageWikibooks contributors <p>Open Textbooks</p> Spanish <p>A course in the Spanish language</p> <p>Wikibooks contributors</p> <p>Lessons in Spanish from the alphabet and greetings to the subjunctive, with vocabulary, grammar and conversation.</p> Start reading <p>11 chapters4 appendices</p>"},{"location":"open-textbooks/wb-spanish/index.html#contents","title":"Contents","text":"<p>Introduction</p> <ul> <li>Introduction to the course</li> <li>The rules of pronunciation</li> </ul> <p>Punto de partida</p> <ul> <li>¿Cómo te llamas?</li> <li>¿Cuándo es tu cumpleaños?</li> <li>Introducción a la gramática</li> </ul> <p>¿Qué opinas?</p> <ul> <li>¿Dónde vives?</li> <li>¿Qué te gusta hacer?</li> <li>¿Qué comes?</li> </ul> <p>¿Cuándo se hará?</p> <ul> <li>¿Qué hora es?</li> <li>¿Adónde vas a ir?</li> <li>¿Cuál es tu trabajo?</li> </ul> <p>Appendices</p> <ul> <li>Appendix A: Common false cognates</li> <li>Appendix B: Idioms</li> <li>Appendix C: Slang words</li> <li>Appendix D: Tenses</li> </ul>"},{"location":"open-textbooks/wb-spanish/index.html#about-this-book","title":"About this book","text":"<p>A course in Spanish for English speakers: pronunciation, nouns, articles and adjectives, regular and irregular verbs and the tenses and moods, pronouns, vocabulary by topic, reading and conversation, and a grammar reference.</p> <p>From Wikibooks · CC BY-SA 4.0</p><p>Spanish, a Wikibooks textbook, by its contributors. This book is not stored in this library: each chapter is read from Wikibooks when it is opened, shown in this library's format, and ends with its own attribution. Licence: CC BY-SA 4.0. Modified: converted to this format.</p>"},{"location":"open-textbooks/wb-spani